f","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2015-07-01","title":"Jul 2015 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=828F1BE1_838B_4062_B0C3_E9910870169E_124836.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJCON_11072026160705_Exchanges_Annual_Report.pdf","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/111230533229.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_24504_BAJAJCON_2023_2024_15072024192544.pdf","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/111229533229.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/13280d5c-1ca5-4226-b919-3a3f4c1f479d.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/73482533229.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/68486533229.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/65052533229.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533229/5332290314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_867_BAJAJCORP_2012_2013_06082013112138.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Bajaj Consumer Care Limited reported strong financial and operational performance for Q2 FY27, backed by robust volume growth in its domestic business and a scaling growth portfolio. The company noted challenges from elevated key commodity prices due to geopolitical conflicts and supply chain disruptions. Management outlined upcoming go-to-market expansion initiatives through Project Aarohan. Financial results reflect the approved Scheme of Arrangement with Vishal Personal Care Limited. Management reported a strong start to FY27 with Q1 revenue of INR341 crores, representing over 28% growth, driven by broad-based performance across urban, rural, and international markets.","themes":{"guidance":[],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Domestic business revenue grew by over thirty percent in Q2 FY27 and H1 FY27.","quote":"Domestic business continued its robust momentum with revenue growth of 30%+ growth in Q2 FY27 and H1 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf"},{"claim":"Growth was driven by strong double-digit unit volume growth.","quote":"This growth was delivered on back of robust double digit unit volume growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf"},{"claim":"Price point packs continued to outperform and remained a key growth engine.","quote":"Price Point Packs continued to outperform and remained a key growth engine, growing ahead of the portfolio growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf"},{"claim":"General trade sustained strong momentum with mid-twenties YoY growth in Q2.","quote":"GT sustained strong momentum, delivering mid-twenties YoY growth in Q2; H1 growth remained in the high twenties.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf"},{"claim":"The current quarter saw continued momentum in the general trade channel with both general and organized trade growing in the strong 20s.","quote":"The current quarter saw a continued momentum in our general trade channel, which grew in line with organized trade with both channels delivering growth in strong 20s.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Rural business saw strong growth in the quarter and grew in line with urban markets.","quote":"Our rural business, which recovered in H2 of last year, saw strong growth in this quarter and grew in line with the urban.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Institutional business was weak for the company and represents less than 1% mix.","quote":"Within the organized trade, both modern trade and e-commerce performed well with growth coming across sub-channel and customers, with the exception of institutional business, which was weak for us. Institutional business is less than 1% mix to the company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Key international markets of Nepal and Bangladesh demonstrated continued double-digit growth and margin improvement.","quote":"Our key markets of Nepal and Bangladesh demonstrated continued double-digit growth and margin improvement.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"The ADHO brand achieved robust underlying volume growth in the early teens for the quarter.","quote":"The brand delivered robust underlying volume growth (adjusted for ml-age reductions) in the early teens for the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d408ea14-7f5c-4ada-a1ef-26ac2c8973a3.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is seeing a positive response from the trade following price corrections in the coconut portfolio.","quote":"Our prices were corrected in beginning of quarter and we are seeing a positive response from trade for the same.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d408ea14-7f5c-4ada-a1ef-26ac2c8973a3.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Gross margins dropped sequentially from 63% in the last quarter to 61.8% due to raw material price volatility, but showed a 510 basis point improvement over Q1 FY26.","quote":"Despite these measures, we saw our gross margins drop from 63% in the sequentially last quarter to 61.8% in this quarter. Please note that while this drop was sequential against quarter four, it was a significant improvement over quarter one FY26, against which we saw 510 basis point improvement.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Advertising spends were maintained at 14.6% during the quarter.","quote":"We continued to invest in this quarter behind our brands and maintained our advertising spends at 14.6% and chose to optimize on the other cost, fixed cost, including employee costs and the other fixed costs, where we were able to take advantage of operating leverage and deliver strong savings against the same quarter last year as well as against the sequential quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Total savings of over 600 basis points were delivered on fixed cost lines against Q1 of FY26.","quote":"In this quarter, if we look at it, we've been delivering, we have been able to deliver a total savings of over 600 basis points on these lines against quarter one of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"Consolidated EBITDA doubled to INR84.4 crores representing a margin of 24.7% and PAT stood at INR70.7 crores with a 20.7% margin.","quote":"Overall, as a result of all of these, our EBITDA on a consolidated basis for quarter one has doubled to deliver an absolute EBITDA of INR84.4 crores, which translates into a margin of 24.7% and the corresponding PAT for quarter one stands at INR70.7 crores with a margin of 20.7.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"The international business is now delivering double-digit EBITDA margins.","quote":"Overall our IB business is now delivering double digit EBDITA, and we are now confident of scaling up this business in a profitable and sustainable manner.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d408ea14-7f5c-4ada-a1ef-26ac2c8973a3.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Bangladesh maintained growth in teens despite a tough operating environment.","quote":"Bangladesh maintained its growth in teens despite a tough operating environment.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf"},{"claim":"The quarter was impacted by unprecedented volatility in raw material prices due to the West Asia war and its cascading impact.","quote":"As we are aware, this quarter was impacted with unprecedented volatility in raw material prices due to the West Asia war and its cascading impact.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"},{"claim":"The war in the Gulf created extreme volatility in petroleum-related products like LLP and packaging material, and led to an inflationary trend in edible oils like mustard and almond.","quote":"On the input costs, the war in Gulf has created extreme volatility in terms of petroleum-related products like LLP and packaging material. It has also led inflationary trend in case of edible oils like mustard and almond, which have not fallen from their historical prices even in the harvest season like they used to do so previously.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Complete Phase 3 of Project Aarohan in H2 FY27.","quote":"Complete Phase 3","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf","timeframe":"H2 FY27"},{"claim":"Execute annual GTM expansion across all states in Q1 FY28.","quote":"Annual GTM expansion","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4bfc9a9f-0eed-40ac-9bf5-53e84dc9e75d.pdf","timeframe":"Q1 FY28"},{"claim":"The company will continue to work on the expansion of its digital footprint through Project Aarohan and stay committed to prudent financial management.","quote":"We will also continue to work on the expansion of our digital footprint through Project Aarohan and shall stay committed to prudent financial management.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8af68139-a8fd-4ca8-937b-df3722171e71.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":21,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":12,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}